1
00:05:02,222 --> 00:05:08,222
Live forever or die trying.

2
00:10:04,444 --> 00:10:10,444
Pirates of the Caribbean: On Stranger Tides is a adventure,
action, fantasy film directed by Rob Marshall.

3
00:15:06,666 --> 00:15:12,666
When Jack crosses paths with a woman from his past, he's not sure if it's love...or if
she's a ruthless con artist using him to find the fabled Fountain of Youth.

4
00:20:08,888 --> 00:20:14,888
Jack Sparrow, played by Johnny Depp.

5
00:25:11,111 --> 00:25:17,111
Angelica, played by Penélope Cruz.

6
00:30:13,333 --> 00:30:19,333
Hector Barbossa, played by Geoffrey Rush.

7
00:35:15,555 --> 00:35:21,555
Edward "Blackbeard" Teach, played by Ian McShane.

8
00:40:17,777 --> 00:40:23,777
Joshamee Gibbs, played by Kevin McNally.

9
00:45:20,000 --> 00:45:26,000
Philip, played by Sam Claflin.

10
00:50:22,222 --> 00:50:28,222
Pirates of the Caribbean: On Stranger Tides is a 2011 American fantasy swashbuckler film that is the fourth
installment in the Pirates of the Caribbean film series, following At World's End (2007).

11
00:55:24,444 --> 00:55:30,444
The film was directed by Rob Marshall, and written by Ted Elliott and Terry Rossio,
loosely based on the 1987 novel On Stranger Tides by Tim Powers.

12
01:00:26,666 --> 01:00:32,666
Johnny Depp, Kevin R.

13
01:05:28,888 --> 01:05:34,888
McNally and Geoffrey Rush reprise their roles from the previous films,
with Penélope Cruz and Ian McShane joining the cast.

14
01:10:31,111 --> 01:10:37,111
The story follows the eccentric pirate Captain Jack Sparrow on a quest for the Fountain of Youth after crossing paths with Angelica, a
mysterious woman from his past, and being forced aboard the Queen Anne's Revenge, the ship of the legendary pirate Blackbeard.

15
01:15:33,333 --> 01:15:39,333
On Stranger Tides was produced by Walt Disney Pictures and Jerry Bruckheimer
Films, and distributed by Walt Disney Studios Motion Pictures.

16
01:20:35,555 --> 01:20:41,555
During the back-to-back production of Dead Man's Chest (2006) and At World's End, writers Elliott and Rossio
first learned of Powers' novel and considered it a good starting point for a new film in the series.

17
01:25:37,777 --> 01:25:43,777
Pre-production started after the end of the 2007–2008 Writers Guild of America
strike, with Depp collaborating with the writers on the story design.

18
01:30:40,000 --> 01:30:46,000
Gore Verbinski did not return as director from previous films
reportedly due to his commitment with Rango (2011).

19
01:35:42,222 --> 01:35:48,222
Principal photography lasted for 106 days between June and November 2010, with
locations in Hawaii, the United Kingdom, Puerto Rico and California.

20
01:40:44,444 --> 01:40:50,444
Filming employed 3D cameras, and ten companies were
involved with the film's visual effects.

21
01:45:46,666 --> 01:45:52,666
Following inflated production costs which ballooned the net budget to $379 million, the
film was the most expensive film ever made at the time of its release.

22
01:50:48,888 --> 01:50:54,888
On Stranger Tides premiered at the Disneyland Resort on May 7, 2011, and
was theatrically released in the United States on May 20.

23
01:55:51,111 --> 01:55:57,111
The film received mixed reviews from critics and grossed over $1 billion worldwide, breaking
several box office records and becoming the third highest-grossing film of 2011.

24
02:00:53,333 --> 02:00:59,333
A fifth film, Dead Men Tell No Tales, was released in 2017.

25
02:05:55,555 --> 02:06:01,555
The film explores themes of sea, ship, mutiny, spain, england.

26
02:10:57,777 --> 02:11:03,777
The tone is lighthearted.
